The VRE bridge's shipped inputs: one directory per project shortcode, whose files the bridge writes
into each of the project's media generations under the names they have here. These are the one
authoritative copy of the files the VRE does not hold, and they are edited here, by hand.

The committed media fixture, areas/access/media/data/0803/ in the generation its Ready token names,
holds the same files byte for byte. It follows this directory: `just check-stand-in-fixture`
(.github/scripts/check-stand-in-fixture.sh, run by `just check`) fails while the two differ, so a
change made here is copied there in the same commit. The fixture's Ready tokens, in media and sync,
record the inputs digest of 0803/, which areas/deposit/vre-bridge/server/tests/refresh_0803.rs pins;
areas/deposit/vre-bridge/CLAUDE.md says what a change here updates with it.

0803/: project 0803 (incunabula), copied from the media fixture's generation
20261007T000000Z-00000000/ with its bytes unchanged.

config.kdl: the CPE configuration of project 0803: its site, labels, pages and the remodel {} block
the store builder reads, in the language docs/src/cpe/config-language.md defines.
narrative/: the editorial texts the configuration names, one Markdown file per text and language
(de, en).
Both are hand-authored and edited in place, never generated.

