They came into this repository as areas/access/cpe/projects/incunabula/config.kdl and narrative/ with
the store builder (DEV-7465); DEV-7511 and DEV-7512 moved them into the media fixture, and DEV-7999
made this copy the authoritative one. The incubator follows when it re-vendors. A change to the
remodel {} block changes Incunabula's store, which cpe-server's Incunabula store pins hold; a
narrative file the configuration names and media does not hold leaves the project not ready.

curation.csv: the curation of project 0803, which CPE reads against sync's snapshot of the project:
what the project's editors authored about single resources. One row per resource, 138 lines with
the header. Hand-authored: it is edited in place by a person and never regenerated. It was
areas/access/sync/data/0803-curation.csv, served inside sync's snapshot, until DEV-7511 and DEV-7512
moved it into the media fixture.

